en-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Urinary epinephrine and norepinephrine interrelations with obesity, insulin, and the metabolic syndrome in Hong Kong Chinese</article-title><source>Metabolism</source><year>2001</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>135</fpage><lpage>143</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11229419</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B6"><label>6</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Poehlman</surname><given-names>ET</given-names></name><name><surname>Gardner</surname><given-names>AW</given-names></name><name><surname>Goran</surname><given-names>MI</given-names></name><name><surname>Arciero</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Toth</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ades</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Calles-Escandon</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sympathetic nervous system activity, body fatness, and body fat distribution in younger and older males</article-title><source>J Appl Physiol</source><year>1995</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>802</fpage><lpage>806</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7775321</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>La Rovere</surname><given-names>MT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Baroreflex sensitivity as a new marker for risk stratification</article-title><source>Z Kardiol</source><year>2000</year><volume>89</volume><fpage>44</fpage><lpage>50</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10810784</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Karason</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>